        "headline": {
          "en": "Boros Dwarves",
          "zh": "红白矮人"
        },
        "order": 1,
        "positioning": {
          "en": "The HOB Dwarves equipment build cleared 5% in both share metrics this week. Kíli and Dáin’s Company provide staying power, while Dwarven Mauler and Raubahn turn equipment into damage. Thorin is probably the deck’s strongest card: he equips everything on entry, and Lavaspur Boots plus Leyline Axe immediately gives him haste, double strike, and trample. He can also remove a blocker as he enters, often ending the game on the spot.",
          "zh": "HOB矮人+武具思路的矮人套牌本周两项占比也都可以超过5%。奇力、戴恩一行给续航，舞锤矮人和劳班装武具打伤害。最强力的应该是梭林，进场装所有武具，有熔刺靴+地脉斧就是敏捷连击践踏，进场还能解一个阻挡者，经常能直接终结比赛。"
        },
        "subtype_id": "boros",
